graph LR
    Praxis["praxis-ai 0.10.0<br/>AI gateway"]

    %% External library dependencies
    Praxis -->|proxy runtime, TLS, LB, admin| PraxisCore["praxis-proxy core/filter/<br/>protocol/tls 0.8.0"]
    PraxisCore -->|HTTP engine| Pingora["pingora-core"]
    Praxis -->|async runtime| Tokio["tokio 1.53.1"]
    Praxis -->|TLS engine, no default provider| Rustls["rustls 0.23.46 /<br/>tokio-rustls 0.26.5"]
    Praxis -->|system libcrypto: TLS, SHA-256, HMAC, RS256| OpenSSL["openssl 0.10.81<br/>(not vendored)"]
    Praxis -->|HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2| Hyper["hyper 1.11.1 / h2 0.4.19"]
    Praxis -->|token counting| Tiktoken["tiktoken-rs 0.12.0"]
    Praxis -->|schema validation| JsonSchema["jsonschema 0.60.1"]
    Praxis -->|secret wrapping| Secrecy["secrecy / zeroize"]
    Praxis -->|allocator| Jemalloc["tikv-jemallocator 0.7.0"]
    Praxis -.->|optional llmd-ext-proc| Tonic["tonic 0.14.6 / prost 0.14.4"]
    Praxis -.->|"optional stores (fork pin 637e7025)"| SQLx["sqlx 0.9.0<br/>praxis-proxy fork"]
    Praxis -.->|optional rate-limit backend| RedisLib["redis 1.7.0"]
    Praxis -.->|optional MCP client| RMCP["rmcp 3.9.0"]

    %% Internal platform dependencies / integrations
    Praxis -->|HTTP upstream, publisher-ID rewrite| LLMISvc["KServe<br/>LLMInferenceService"]
    Praxis -.->|gRPC ext_proc| LLMD["llm-d EPP"]
    Praxis -->|HTTP upstream| VLLM["vLLM"]
    Praxis -->|HTTP upstream, identity headers| OGX["OGX<br/>(formerly llama-stack)"]
    Praxis -->|HTTP callout| Guardrails["NeMo / TrustyAI Guardrails"]

    %% External services
    Praxis -->|HTTPS 443, SigV4| Bedrock["AWS Bedrock"]
    Praxis -->|HTTPS 443, Entra ID| Azure["Azure OpenAI"]
    Praxis -->|HTTPS 443, GCP ADC| Vertex["Google Vertex AI"]
    Praxis -->|HTTPS 443| SaaS["OpenAI / Anthropic"]
    Praxis -.->|HTTPS 443| Lakera["Lakera / metering /<br/>search / MCP servers"]
    Praxis -.->|PostgreSQL 5432 TLS| PG[("PostgreSQL / SQLite")]
    Praxis -.->|RESP TLS| Valkey[("Valkey / Redis Sentinel")]

    %% Consumers
    Prom["Prometheus"] -->|scrape 9901| Praxis
    Deployer["Consuming platform<br/>(operator / Helm / llm-d)"] -->|supplies Deployment,<br/>Service, config| Praxis

